廠商。<br><br>3稅減免&nbsp;3費補助&nbsp;&nbsp;3年專業管理。<br><br>租金補貼試算連結:&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pip.moi.gov.tw/V3/B/SCRB0104.aspx\">https://pip.moi.gov.tw/V3/B/SCRB0104.aspx</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>有任何問題歡迎加入我的LINE<br><br>🥇不動產營業員葉韋辰（113）登字第483318號<br><br>🥇租賃管理人員葉韋辰(114)登字第020348號<br><br>🥇不動產經紀人徐素珍&nbsp;(103)基市字第00264號</p>\r\n附近有便利商店、公園綠地。\r\n本房屋近江山萬里公車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "江山萬里 汐止區新台五路二段", "lat": "25.0667897", "lng": "121.6731129", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "活力社區站", "distance": 129, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約129公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "茄苳腳(茄安街口)站", "distance": 150, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約150公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "茄安街口[新巴士]站", "distance": 155, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約155公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "Happy - 黑皮選物販賣、娃娃機", "distance": 1431, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1431公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "瑞麟美而美", "distance": 94, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約94公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "市立崇德國小補校", "distance": 503, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約503公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立秀峰高級中學", "distance": 1239, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1239公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "11,000元/月 (可申請租金補貼)", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月租金", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "不收服務費", "key": "serviceFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "1,500元/月", "key": "manageprice"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "住家用", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "7.7坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "建物面積", "value": "4.61坪", "key": "buildArea", "alias": "(不含公設)", "cate": 2}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": 